sequenceDiagram
    participant Product as Product<br>[implements GattClientResponse]
    participant CN as CN<br>[implements GattClient]

    Note over Product, CN: Only one acknowledged operation at a time

    Product->>CN: GattClient.WriteCharacteristic(handle=0x0025, data=0x01)
    Note right of Product: Must wait for OperationComplete
    CN-->>Product: GattClientResponse.OperationComplete(success)

    Product->>CN: GattClient.ReadCharacteristic(0x0025)
    Note right of Product: Must wait for OperationComplete
    CN-->>Product: GattClientResponse.ReadCharacteristicResponse(<br>data={handle=0x0025, data=0x64})
    CN-->>Product: GattClientResponse.OperationComplete(success)

    Note over Product, CN: WriteWithoutResponse is fire-and-forget, no wait needed

    Product->>CN: GattClient.WriteCharacteristicWithoutResponse(<br>handle=0x0027, data=0x11)
    Product->>CN: GattClient.WriteCharacteristicWithoutResponse(<br>handle=0x0027, data=0x22)
    Product->>CN: GattClient.WriteCharacteristic(<br>handle=0x0025, data=0x33)
    CN-->>Product: GattClientResponse.OperationComplete(success)
